ents/3154127920","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109258#issuecomment-3154127920","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109258","id":3154127920,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68ACww","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-05T08:41:26Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T08:41:26Z","body":"- I can reproduce this as well:\n<sub>Godot v4.5.beta (2d113cc22) - Fedora Linux 42 (Workstation Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7600 (RADV NAVI33) - AMD Ryzen 7 7700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 30.45 GiB memory</sub>\n\n- However it does not happen when using the compatiblity renderer:\n<sub>Godot v4.5.beta (2d113cc22) - Fedora Linux 42 (Workstation Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 7600 (radeonsi, navi33, LLVM 20.1.6, DRM 3.63, 6.15.7-200.fc42.x86_64) - AMD Ryzen 7 7700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 30.45 GiB memory</sub>\n\n- The slowdown is tied to the CreateScriptDialog being fully obstructed by the file dialog. As soon as some part of the CreateScriptDialog is visible (e.g. by moving the file dialog, or by maximizing the script dialog before opening the file dialog) the slowdown disappears.\n\n- I highly suspect, that this is the same root issue as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102580 for me, since disabling editor VSync fixes the issue as well.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3154127920/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3154176145","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109258#issuecomment-3154176145","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109258","id":3154176145,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68AOiR","user":{"login":"jjszaniszlo","id":40372435,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMzcyNDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40372435?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo","html_url":"https://github.com/jjszaniszlo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jjszaniszlo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_ty